  "table-sort": {
   "category": "feedback",
   "type": "select-toggle",
   "name": {
    "zh": "排序箭头翻转",
    "en": "Sort arrow flip"
   },
   "summary": {
    "zh": "点表头排序时，箭头翻转方向，这一列短暂亮一下",
    "en": "Sorting flips the header arrow and briefly highlights the column"
   },
   "trigger": {
    "zh": "点击表头排序",
    "en": "Click a column header to sort"
   },
   "duration": {
    "zh": "250ms",
    "en": "250ms"
   },
   "use": {
    "zh": "- 可以排序的表格、列表\n- 让用户确认「已经按这一列排好了」\n\n**不要用：** 不能排序的表头，箭头会误导。",
    "en": "- Sortable tables and lists\n- Confirming the table is now sorted by this column\n\n**Don't use:** on headers that can't sort."
   },
   "reduced": {
    "zh": "- 替代方式：箭头直接换方向，列不闪\n- 保留的信息：按哪一列、升序还是降序",
    "en": "- Instead: the arrow switches instantly, no column flash\n- Still communicates: which column and which direction"
   },
   "tips": {
    "zh": "- 表头用 `aria-sort`，读屏会读出「升序」「降序」\n- 想让行也平滑换位置，可以加上「列表重排」动效",
    "en": "- Use `aria-sort` on the header so screen readers announce the direction\n- For rows that glide to new places, add the list-reorder motion"
   },
   "html": "<table class=\"tbl\">\n  <thead><tr>\n    <th scope=\"col\">课程</th>\n    <th scope=\"col\" aria-sort=\"none\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"sort\">学习人数 <span class=\"sort__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></button></th>\n  </tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>一元一次方程</td><td>12840</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>分数加减</td><td>9320</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>几何入门</td><td>15210</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
   "css": ".tbl { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; border-collapse: collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.tbl th, .tbl td { padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }\n.tbl th { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-muted); }\n.sort { border: 0; background: none; padding: 0; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; }\n.sort__arrow { display: inline-block; opacity: 0.35; }\nth[aria-sort=\"ascending\"] .sort__arrow, th[aria-sort=\"descending\"] .sort__arrow { opacity: 1; }\nth[aria-sort=\"descending\"] .sort__arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); }\n.sort__arrow { transition: transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out), opacity var(--duration-fast); }\n.tbl.is-sorted td:nth-child(2) { animation: col-flash 600ms var(--ease-out); }\n@keyframes col-flash { from { background: var(--color-primary-soft); } }",
   "js": "document.querySelectorAll(\".tbl\").forEach((tbl) => {\n  tbl.querySelectorAll(\"th .sort\").forEach((btn) => {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      const th = btn.closest(\"th\"), col = [...th.parentElement.children].indexOf(th);\n      const asc = th.getAttribute(\"aria-sort\") !== \"ascending\";\n      th.setAttribute(\"aria-sort\", asc ? \"ascending\" : \"descending\");\n      const body = tbl.tBodies[0];\n      [...body.rows].sort((a, b) => (Number(a.cells[col].textContent) - Number(b.cells[col].textContent)) * (asc ? 1 : -1)).forEach((r) => body.appendChild(r));\n      tbl.classList.remove(\"is-sorted\"); void tbl.offsetWidth; tbl.classList.add(\"is-sorted\");\n    });\n  });\n});",
   "rmcss": "@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .sort__arrow { transition: none; }\n  .tbl.is-sorted td:nth-child(2) { animation: none; }\n}",
   "ref": "",
   "kw": {
    "zh": [
     "表格",
     "排序",
     "箭头",
     "翻转"
    ],
    "en": [
     "table",
     "sort",
     "arrow",
     "flip"
    ]
   }
  },
  "toast-rise": {
   "category": "feedback",
   "type": "notice",
   "name": {
    "zh": "消息上浮",
    "en": "Toast rise"
   },
   "summary": {
    "zh": "消息从底部升起，带一点模糊和回弹，几秒后自己退下去",
    "en": "The toast rises from the bottom out of a slight blur with a little bounce, then leaves after a few seconds"
   },
   "trigger": {
    "zh": "操作完成后（保存、复制、加入购物车）",
    "en": "After an action completes (save, copy, add to cart)"
   },
   "duration": {
    "zh": "450ms",
    "en": "450ms"
   },
   "use": {
    "zh": "- 操作成功的轻提示：已保存、已复制、已加入购物车\n- 不需要用户回应的信息\n\n**不要用：** 错误和需要用户处理的事（那用警告提示，放在出错的地方）。",
    "en": "- Light confirmations: saved, copied, added to cart\n- Information that needs no response\n\n**Don't use:** for errors or anything users must act on (use an alert near the problem)."
   },
   "reduced": {
    "zh": "- 替代方式：消息直接淡入，到时间直接消失，不移动\n- 保留的信息：消息内容（读屏通过 `aria-live` 照样读出）",
    "en": "- Instead: the toast fades in and disappears on time, no movement\n- Still communicates: the message (still announced through `aria-live`)"
   },
   "tips": {
    "zh": "- 容器用 `aria-live=\"polite\"`，读屏会读出消息，但不打断用户\n- 停留 4 秒左右；有「撤销」按钮的要更久，而且鼠标停在上面时不要消失\n- 离开比出现快\n- 效果参考 Animate UI 的 Toast，独立实现",
    "en": "- Use `aria-live=\"polite\"` on the container so it's announced without interrupting\n- Keep it ~4 seconds; longer if it has an Undo button, and don't dismiss while hovered\n- Leave faster than you arrive\n- Inspired by Animate UI's Toast, implemented independently"
   },
   "html": "<div class=\"toasts\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-toast=\"rise\">保存</button>",
   "css": ".toasts { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: var(--space-6); translate: -50% 0; z-index: 1000; display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); justify-items: center; }\n.toast { padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-text); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }\n.toast--rise { animation: toast-rise 450ms var(--ease-spring); }\n.toast--rise.is-leaving { animation: toast-rise-out 200ms ease-in forwards; }\n@keyframes toast-rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(100%) scale(0.96); filter: blur(4px); } }\n@keyframes toast-rise-out { to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(100%) scale(0.96); filter: blur(4px); } }",
   "js": "function showToast(text, variant) {\n  const box = document.querySelector(\".toasts\");\n  const t = document.createElement(\"div\");\n  t.className = \"toast toast--\" + variant;\n  t.textContent = text;\n  box.appendChild(t);\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    if (matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches) return t.remove();\n    t.classList.add(\"is-leaving\");\n    t.addEventListener(\"animationend\", () => t.remove(), { once: true });\n  }, 4000);\n}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-toast=\"rise\"]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener(\"click\", () => showToast(\"已保存\", \"rise\")));",
   "rmcss": "@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .toast--rise { animation: toast-fade 150ms linear; }\n  @keyframes toast-fade { from { opacity: 0; } }\n}",
   "ref": "Animate UI · Toast",
   "kw": {
    "zh": [
     "消息",
     "提示",
     "上浮",
     "通知"
    ],
    "en": [
     "toast",
     "message",
     "rise",
     "notification"
    ]
   },
   "rec": true
  },
